---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Decks
description: Canadian Highlander decklists from Moxfield. What players are brewing right now, ready to copy.
pageClass: decks
permalink: /decks/
---
{%- from "partials/macros.njk" import decktile -%}
<header class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Decks</p>
    <h1 class="page-head__title">Steal a deck. <em>Make it yours.</em></h1>
    <p class="page-head__lede">What people are brewing this month. Find one that looks like fun and have it on the table tonight.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="carousel carousel--feature" data-carousel>
    <div class="carousel__track" data-track tabindex="0" aria-label="Deck carousel">
      {%- for d in decks.decks | rotation %}
      <div class="carousel__slide">{{ decktile(d, decks.authors) }}</div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="carousel__controls">
      <button class="carousel__btn" type="button" data-prev aria-label="Previous decks">←</button>
      <span class="carousel__count mono" data-count></span>
      <button class="carousel__btn" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next decks">→</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- set community = decks.decks | rejectattr("pinned") | list %}
  {%- set pinned = decks.decks | selectattr("pinned") | list %}
  <div class="section__head section__head--row decks-all">
    <h2 class="h3">Fresh from the community <span class="mono decks-count">{{ community.length }}</span></h2>
    <p class="mono decks-snap">Updated {{ decks.snapshot | longDate }}</p>
  </div>
  <div class="deckgrid">
    {%- for d in community %}{{ decktile(d, decks.authors) }}{% endfor %}
  </div>

  {%- if pinned.length %}
  <div class="section__head section__head--row decks-all">
    <h2 class="h3">Saltboi's shelf <span class="mono decks-count">{{ pinned.length }}</span></h2>
    <a class="link-arrow" href="{{ decks.authors.Saltboi.url }}">Saltboi on Moxfield <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="deckgrid">
    {%- for d in pinned %}{{ decktile(d, decks.authors) }}{% endfor %}
  </div>
  {%- endif %}

  <aside class="suggest">
    <div>
      <h2 class="h3">Want your deck in the rotation?</h2>
      <p>Make it public on Moxfield, set the format to Canadian Highlander, and keep tuning it. Recently updated lists with more than {{ decks.rules.minViews }} views make the rotation.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="https://mtgdecks.net/Canadian-Highlander">Tournament results ↗</a>
  </aside>
</div>
